1
00:00:00,620 --> 00:00:03,124
One coffee. Keep the change.

2
00:00:03,164 --> 00:00:04,991
We don't take stars.

3
00:00:05,031 --> 00:00:06,789
It's a small one.

4
00:00:07,159 --> 00:00:11,178
It's so warm! Rae,
it's like holding a puppy!

5
00:00:11,218 --> 00:00:14,282
Pip. Your hair is on fire.

6
00:00:14,452 --> 00:00:15,818
Only a little!

7
00:00:15,888 --> 00:00:20,136
Reminder: all currency must be
cooler than the store.

8
00:00:20,176 --> 00:00:23,397
Fine. I'll pay with a moon.

9
00:00:25,267 --> 00:00:27,151
Ooh! Can we keep it?

10
00:00:27,191 --> 00:00:28,400
No.

11
00:00:28,770 --> 00:00:32,027
Do you have anything... normal?

12
00:00:32,067 --> 00:00:33,298
A coupon?

13
00:00:33,338 --> 00:00:34,924
Expired.

14
00:00:34,964 --> 00:00:37,176
You didn't even look at it.

15
00:00:37,216 --> 00:00:40,019
Everything here is expired.
